Then
\begin{align*} \label{eq:1}\sum_{m=1}^n \left(\left(1+\frac{m^2}{n^3}\right)^{1/4}-1\right) &\approx \sum_{m=1}^n \left(1 + \frac{1}{4}\frac{m^2}{n^3} - \frac{1}{32}\frac{m^4}{n^6} + \dots - 1\right) \\ &= \sum_{m=1}^n \left(\frac{1}{4}\frac{m^2}{n^3} - \frac{1}{32}\frac{m^4}{n^6} + \dots\right) \\ &= \frac{1}{4n^3} \sum_{m=1}^n m^2 - \frac{1}{32n^6} \sum_{m=1}^n m^4 + \dots\end{align*}
We know that $\sum_{m=1}^n m^2 = \frac{n(n+1)(2n+1)}{6} = \frac{2n^3 + 3n^2 + n}{6}$ and $\sum_{m=1}^n m^4 = \frac{n(n+1)(2n+1)(3n^2+3n-1)}{30} = \frac{6n^5 + 15n^4 + 10n^3 - n}{30}$.
Then
\begin{align*}\frac{1}{4n^3} \sum_{m=1}^n m^2 &= \frac{1}{4n^3} \frac{2n^3 + 3n^2 + n}{6} = \frac{2n^3 + 3n^2 + n}{24n^3} = \frac{1}{12} + \frac{1}{8n} + \frac{1}{24n^2} \\ \frac{1}{32n^6} \sum_{m=1}^n m^4 &= \frac{1}{32n^6} \frac{6n^5 + 15n^4 + 10n^3 - n}{30} = \frac{6n^5 + 15n^4 + 10n^3 - n}{960n^6} = \frac{1}{160n} + \frac{1}{64n^2} + \frac{1}{96n^3} - \frac{1}{960n^5}\end{align*}
Thus,
\begin{align*}\sum_{m=1}^n \left(\left(1+\frac{m^2}{n^3}\right)^{1/4}-1\right) &\approx \frac{1}{12} + \frac{1}{8n} + \frac{1}{24n^2} - \left(\frac{1}{160n} + \frac{1}{64n^2} + \frac{1}{96n^3} - \frac{1}{960n^5}\right) + \dots \\ &= \frac{1}{12} + \left(\frac{1}{8} - \frac{1}{160}\right)\frac{1}{n} + \left(\frac{1}{24} - \frac{1}{64}\right)\frac{1}{n^2} + \dots \\ &= \frac{1}{12} + \frac{20-1}{160}\frac{1}{n} + \frac{8-3}{192}\frac{1}{n^2} + \dots \\ &= \frac{1}{12} + \frac{19}{160n} + \frac{5}{192n^2} + \dots\end{align*}
